WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A made-up world in Neuraxic’s own interface. Choose a tome to begin.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.100
Open the world, then focus on one of its elements.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.160
Canon claims and an unsealed proposal stay visibly distinct.

4
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:18.200
Read the draft beside the app’s suggested rules, names and quantities. None is accepted.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.300
See the named relationships around the same subject.

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.400
Switch lenses to see claims with time marks. The proposal keeps its dashed outline.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:34.480
Return to the unsealed proposal. Nothing was saved or accepted along the way.
